recommend keep-going -- four roster reds stand named and untaken (dated_path, dated_spelling, season_leaf_choir, two_rooms_doorway); the next audit lap takes the smallest of them, or rotates to Civic over the mand policy surfaces now that their door reads plainly. The ASCII program-content question waits on Pheromone's lane rather than mine.
